    {
      "id": "p18:b12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "provider_label": "text",
      "text": "（1）企业财务战略：指企业对维持和扩大生产经营活动所需资金进行筹集，分配，使用，并实现企业总体战略目标所作出的长远性谋划和方略\n",
      "reading_order": 13,
      "provider_sequence": 12,
      "parent_id": null,
      "children": [],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "page_number": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.1475211608222491,
            0.30948988315759474,
            0.8472390165255945,
            0.33998290111142776
          ],
          "character_span": null
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "uncertain",
      "completeness": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "id": "p18:b13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "provider_label": "text",
      "text": "（2）负债经营战略：指企业向商业银行等金融企业或向信托投资公司等非金融性企业借款，或通过有关银行向社会发行企业债券，以筹集所需资金用于生产经营活动的一种战略\n",
      "reading_order": 14,
      "provider_sequence": 13,
      "parent_id": null,
      "children": [],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "page_number": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.14631197097944376,
            0.34625249358791677,
            0.8500604594921403,
            0.3958392704474209
          ],
          "character_span": null
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "uncertain",
      "completeness": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "id": "p18:b14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "provider_label": "text",
      "text": "（3）内源型筹资战略：指依靠企业内部筹资解决生产经营活动所需资金的渠道战略，通过内部筹资主要是指利用企业内部的留成利润（主要表现为盈余公积金和未分配利润）；应付税款（尚未到期的应交税款）；折旧准备基金；企业内部集资；盘活企业内部存量资产\n",
      "reading_order": 15,
      "provider_sequence": 14,
      "parent_id": null,
      "children": [],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "page_number": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.14631197097944376,
            0.402393844400114,
            0.8516727126158807,
            0.4702194357366771
          ],
          "character_span": null
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "uncertain",
      "completeness": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "id": "p18:b15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "provider_label": "text",
      "text": "（4）直接融资战略：指企业直接进入证券市场，通过发行股票和债券等方式筹集资金的渠道战略\n",
      "reading_order": 16,
      "provider_sequence": 15,
      "parent_id": null,
      "children": [],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "page_number": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.1475211608222491,
            0.47648902821316613,
            0.848851269649335,
            0.5075520091194072
          ],
          "character_span": null
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "uncertain",
      "completeness": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "id": "p18:b16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "provider_label": "text",
      "text": "（5）资本的经营风险：指企业在经营活动中由于企业外部环境诸多因素的变化，特别是市场因素的变化，使经营成果出现向坏的方向转化的危险\n",
      "reading_order": 17,
      "provider_sequence": 16,
      "parent_id": null,
      "children": [],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "page_number": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.14671503426037888,
            0.5129666571672842,
            0.8391777509068924,
            0.5445996010259333
          ],
          "character_span": null
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "uncertain",
      "completeness": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "id": "p18:b17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "provider_label": "text",
      "text": "（6）资本的财务风险：指因扩大经营规模或扩大经营领域的需要，企业举债筹集资本而产生的失利的危险\n",
      "reading_order": 18,
      "provider_sequence": 17,
      "parent_id": null,
      "children": [],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "page_number": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.147118097541314,
            0.5502992305500143,
            0.848851269649335,
            0.5819321744086634
          ],
          "character_span": null
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "uncertain",
      "completeness": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "id": "p18:b18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "provider_label": "text",
      "text": "（7）终值评价法：指利用资本的时间价值计算将来值，用以对投资或筹资方案作出评价的方法\n",
      "reading_order": 19,
      "provider_sequence": 18,
      "parent_id": null,
      "children": [],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "page_number": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.147118097541314,
            0.5879167854089484,
            0.848851269649335,
            0.6186947848389854
          ],
          "character_span": null
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "uncertain",
      "completeness": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "id": "p18:b19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "provider_label": "text",
      "text": "（8）风险评价法：指通过对风险大小的测算与效益的估算，以及企业承受和分散风险的能力的分析，对投资或筹资方案作出评价和选择的方法\n",
      "reading_order": 20,
      "provider_sequence": 19,
      "parent_id": null,
      "children": [],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "page_number": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.147118097541314,
            0.6243944143630664,
            0.8492543329302701,
            0.6560273582217155
          ],
          "character_span": null
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "uncertain",
      "completeness": "unknown"
    },
