    {
      "id": "p18:b24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "provider_label": "text",
      "text": "（三）企业筹资战略类型",
      "reading_order": 25,
      "provider_sequence": 24,
      "parent_id": null,
      "children": [],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "page_number": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.22692462716646514,
            0.7355371900826446,
            0.4195888754534462,
            0.7483613565118268
          ],
          "character_span": null
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "uncertain",
      "completeness": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "id": "p18:b25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "provider_label": "text",
      "text": "（1）按筹资的方式不同（资本积聚；负债经营；合资或合作经营；股份经营：“三来一补”)\n",
      "reading_order": 26,
      "provider_sequence": 25,
      "parent_id": null,
      "children": [],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "page_number": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.14671503426037888,
            0.7543459675121117,
            0.8484482063683998,
            0.7856939298945569
          ],
          "character_span": null
        }
      ],
      "disposition": "uncertain",
      "completeness": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "id": "p18:b26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "provider_label": "text",
      "text": "（2）按筹资的渠道不同（内源型；外源型<间接融资和直接融资>)",
      "reading_order": 27,
      "provider_sequence": 26,
      "parent_id": null,
      "children": [],
      "source_spans": [
        {
          "page_number": 18,
          "bbox": [
